WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.069
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:04.537
We hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:05.905
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:07.139
Florida Governor
Ron DeSantis yesterday

00:00:07.139 --> 00:00:09.342
signed a bill that allows
residents to carry

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:11.443
concealed loaded weapons
without a permit.

00:00:11.443 --> 00:00:14.914
UConn won the NCAA tournament,
and Finland join NATO.

00:00:14.914 --> 00:00:17.584
And I think that's
all the other stuff.

00:00:17.584 --> 00:00:22.589
Now, former president Trump
was arraigned today

00:00:22.589 --> 00:00:24.190
inside the New York
County Criminal Court

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:25.558
in lower Manhattan.

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:28.494
And I think it really says
something that the craziest part

00:00:28.494 --> 00:00:31.431
of that sentence
is still "former president."

00:00:31.431 --> 00:00:36.135
That guy was the president
of the country.

00:00:36.135 --> 00:00:38.771
If you asked for the manager
at Best Buy

00:00:38.771 --> 00:00:43.743
and that guy came over,
you'd say, "No, the manager."

00:00:45.445 --> 00:00:46.746
That's right --
former president Trump

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:48.181
was arraigned today
in Manhattan.

00:00:48.181 --> 00:00:50.716
And like anyone else,
Trump is presumed innocent

00:00:50.716 --> 00:00:53.887
until he outright confesses
on Truth Social.

00:00:56.055 --> 00:00:59.359
Trump was arraigned today
inside a New York courtroom.

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:02.796
Cameras weren't allowed, but
they did have a sketch artist.

00:01:06.132 --> 00:01:07.901
Former president Trump
was set to speak tonight

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:10.336
at Mar-a-Lago following his
arraignment today in New York.

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:13.973
Wait. They're letting him go?

00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:15.875
Does anything scream
flight risk

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:19.512
more than a guy
with his own plane?

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:21.981
It's a flight guarantee.

00:01:21.981 --> 00:01:24.117
Attorney Todd Blanche announced
yesterday that he's joined

00:01:24.117 --> 00:01:25.885
former president Trump's
criminal defense team

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:27.353
and said joining the team was

00:01:27.353 --> 00:01:29.489
"an opportunity
he could not pass up."

00:01:29.489 --> 00:01:32.024
An opportunity to what?
Also go to prison?

00:01:32.024 --> 00:01:35.227
Yeah, I mean, who wouldn't want
to join the illustrious ranks

00:01:35.227 --> 00:01:36.862
of Michael Cohen
and the guy who didn't know

00:01:36.862 --> 00:01:40.200
Four Seasons was a hotel?

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.101
New York Mayor
Eric Adams warned yesterday

00:01:42.101 --> 00:01:44.370
that the city is prepared for
former president Trump's

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.439
arraignment and said,
"While there may be

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:48.173
some rabble-rousers
thinking about coming

00:01:48.173 --> 00:01:50.443
to our city tomorrow, our
message is clear and simple --

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:51.744
control yourselves."

00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:56.749
My question is, where was
that leadership before SantaCon?

00:01:59.952 --> 00:02:01.988
Kellen Curry,
an Afghanistan war veteran

00:02:01.988 --> 00:02:03.822
and former executive
at J.P. Morgan,

00:02:03.822 --> 00:02:05.891
announced this week
that he will challenge New York

00:02:05.891 --> 00:02:08.661
Congressman George Santos in
the Republican primary.

00:02:08.661 --> 00:02:11.497
Sounds impressive.
Do we have a photo of Curry?

00:02:11.497 --> 00:02:13.133
George!

00:02:16.102 --> 00:02:18.671
Disney C.E.O. Bob Iger
criticized Florida Governor

00:02:18.671 --> 00:02:20.673
Ron DeSantis yesterday
for his decision

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:23.709
to strip the company of its
special self-governing status

00:02:23.709 --> 00:02:28.114
and, to get him back, announced
Minnie is just Mickey in drag.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.251
Paris residents over the weekend

00:02:32.251 --> 00:02:34.220
voted to ban electric scooters
from the city,

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:36.589
which is wise, because
it's really hard to fall in love

00:02:36.589 --> 00:02:40.960
with someone once you've
seen them ride a scooter.

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:43.162
And, finally,
today was Tell a Lie Day.

00:02:43.162 --> 00:02:45.297
Said one celebrant,
"Not guilty."

00:02:45.297 --> 00:02:48.400
And that -- You guys,
that was the monologue.

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:49.769
We're off and running.
[ Cheers and applause ]

